#: .\admin.py:448
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Retained %(n)d key(s): %(reasons)s. Nothing changed — they stay scheduled, "
"so resolving the cause and deleting again works. Set "
"KEY_DELETION_CAN_RENDER_DATA_INACCESSIBLE to True in ENCRYPTION to delete "
"them regardless, making that data permanently unreadable."
msgstr ""
"%(n)d chave(s) mantida(s): %(reasons)s. Nada mudou — elas continuam "
"agendadas, então resolver a causa e excluir novamente funciona. Defina "
"KEY_DELETION_CAN_RENDER_DATA_INACCESSIBLE como True em ENCRYPTION para "
"excluí-las mesmo assim, tornando esses dados permanentemente ilegíveis."

#: .\admin.py:464
